dyno run: execute a session

Usage: dyno run --models LIST [options]

Options:
  --api-key-env name           environment variable name for bearer authentication (default: OPENAI_API_KEY)
  --backend string             inference protocol: ollama or openai (default: ollama)
  --base-url URL               full OpenAI-compatible API base URL, including its path
  --cache modes                cache modes: miss, continue, prefix (default miss)
  --db path                    database path (default /home/max/.local/share/dyno/bench.db)
  --host URL                   server URL; OpenAI API-base alias (Ollama default: OLLAMA_HOST or http://127.0.0.1:11434)
  --interval duration          pause between two steps, 0 or more (default 30s)
  --keep-alive duration        how long the server keeps a model loaded, longer than the interval (default: max(10m, interval + 5m))
  --log file                   file that gets a plain-text copy of the session events
  --model-revision revision    operator-supplied immutable model revision (single model; unpadded printable max 64, or sha256:<64 hex>)
  --models names               comma-separated model names (required)
  --num-ctx int                context size in tokens, 1 or more (default 8192)
  --num-predict int            tokens to generate in each request, 1 or more (default 512)
  --omit-seed                  omit seed for compatible endpoints that reject it; record that policy
  --omit-temperature           omit temperature for compatible endpoints that reject it; record that policy
  --order order                step order: model, round-robin (default model)
  --plain                      plain text, also in a terminal
  --prompt set                 prompt set: short, long, or a JSON file (default: short for --cache miss, else long)
  --request-timeout duration   limit of one request (default 10m0s)
  --runs int                   measured runs of each model and cache mode, 1 or more (default 5)
  --seed int                   sampling seed (default 42)
  --server engine              declared compatible server engine: unknown or vllm (not its version)
  --server-version version     operator-supplied compatible server version (max 64 printable characters)
  --skip-model-discovery       use supplied IDs without calling the models endpoint
  --tag text                   printable text that marks the session (no controls; unrestricted length)
  --temperature float          sampling temperature, 0 or more
  --token-limit-field string   compatible token-limit field: max_tokens or max_completion_tokens (default: max_tokens)
  --usage string               streaming usage policy: required or off (default: required)
  -h, --help                   show this help
